  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br />for numerator to be zero <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />now after rationalization,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br />again&nbsp;on rationalization,</p><p><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p>"
